<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Dear&nbsp;{!Contact.FirstName},</span></font><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><div><font face="arial">Thank you for completing your Incomplete Grade Request form. A copy of the form for your records is attached and serves as an official notice to you that your request for an Incomplete has been granted.To remove the Incomplete you must complete all the work described on the form by your instructor. Arizona State University policy grants you one calendar year to complete the work, with this year measured from the last day of the semester in which you received the Incomplete. In some circumstances (for example, separation from service, retirement) your instructor may specify an earlier completion date. Earlier completion dates must be approved by the Associate Director for Academic Affairs in the School of Music.</font></div><div><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial">Please contact <a href="mailto:musicstudents@asu.edu">musicstudents@asu.edu</a> if you have any questions.</font></div><div><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial">Sincerely,</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><br></div></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><b style="font-size: 12pt;">Julie Stephens</b></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial" color="#999999">Coordinator, Academic Affairs + Admissions</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><b><font color="#990000">Arizona State University</font>&nbsp;|&nbsp;</b></font><b style="color: rgb(255, 204, 0); font-size: 12pt;">Herberger Institute for Design and the Arts&nbsp;</b></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(153, 153, 153);">P.O. Box 870405 |&nbsp;</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(153, 153, 153);">Tempe, Arizona 85287-0405</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font color="#999999">Phone: 480-965-5069</font></div><div><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><font color="#ffffff">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></span></div></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>